<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="220366094"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:24.173"><div begin="29.418" end="43.798" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.418" end="32.795" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.418" end="30.667">吹红了桃</span><span begin="30.667" end="31.009">花</span> <span begin="31.202" end="32.402">吹绿了柳</span><span begin="32.402" end="32.795">树</span></p><p begin="32.931" end="36.536" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.931" end="34.715">你在路上总会</span><span begin="34.715" end="35.855">安慰</span><span begin="35.855" end="36.536">谁</span></p><p begin="36.552" end="39.894" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.552" end="37.777">吹醒了青</span><span begin="37.777" end="38.180">蛙</span> <span begin="38.317" end="39.403">吹来了燕</span><span begin="39.403" end="39.894">子</span></p><p begin="39.999" end="43.798" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.999" end="41.674">我在城里刚好</span><span begin="41.674" end="42.918">缺了</span><span begin="42.918" end="43.798">谁</span></p></div><div begin="43.888" end="55.765" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.888" end="48.345" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.888" end="44.219">你</span><span begin="44.219" end="44.844">纵</span><span begin="44.844" end="45.176">然</span><span begin="45.176" end="45.698">带</span><span begin="45.698" end="45.981">来</span><span begin="45.981" end="46.458">地</span><span begin="46.458" end="46.888">下</span><span begin="46.888" end="47.389">的</span><span begin="47.389" end="47.702">玫</span><span begin="47.702" end="48.345">瑰</span></p><p begin="48.355" end="52.326" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.355" end="48.931">能</span><span begin="48.931" end="49.316">否</span><span begin="49.316" end="50.247">收</span><span begin="50.247" end="51.712">回地上的滋</span><span begin="51.712" end="52.326">味</span></p><p begin="52.396" end="55.765" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.396" end="53.289">有人唱</span><span begin="53.289" end="54.231">胡</span><span begin="54.231" end="54.478">不</span><span begin="54.478" end="55.765">归</span></p></div><div begin="57.688" end="1:31.781" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="57.688" end="1:00.547" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.688" end="58.438">春风</span><span begin="58.438" end="59.352">一吹</span><span begin="59.352" end="1:00.038">想起</span><span begin="1:00.038" end="1:00.547">谁</span></p><p begin="1:00.557" end="1:04.522" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.557" end="1:02.305">有所谓无所谓</span> <span begin="1:02.305" end="1:02.889">只要</span><span begin="1:02.889" end="1:04.089">不后</span><span begin="1:04.089" end="1:04.522">悔</span></p><p begin="1:04.659" end="1:07.555" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.659" end="1:05.415">春风</span><span begin="1:05.415" end="1:06.483">一吹</span><span begin="1:06.483" end="1:06.955">忘了</span><span begin="1:06.955" end="1:07.555">谁</span></p><p begin="1:07.777" end="1:12.127" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.777" end="1:08.045">我</span><span begin="1:08.045" end="1:08.777">上</span><span begin="1:08.777" end="1:09.892">一次流泪</span><span begin="1:09.892" end="1:10.943">又几</span><span begin="1:10.943" end="1:12.127">岁</span></p><p begin="1:12.240" end="1:16.651" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.240" end="1:12.919">你会</span><span begin="1:12.919" end="1:14.166">退</span> <span begin="1:14.166" end="1:14.671">我想</span><span begin="1:14.671" end="1:15.651">追</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:13.472" end="1:14.062">(洞里</span><span begin="1:14.062" end="1:15.224">蛇</span> <span begin="1:15.224" end="1:15.710">冬日</span><span begin="1:15.710" end="1:16.651">睡)</span></span></p><p begin="1:15.698" end="1:20.158" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.698" end="1:16.299">会不</span><span begin="1:16.299" end="1:17.524">会</span> <span begin="1:17.524" end="1:18.082">对不</span><span begin="1:18.082" end="1:19.034">对</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:17.100" end="1:17.510">(原上</span><span begin="1:17.510" end="1:18.586">草</span> <span begin="1:18.586" end="1:19.158">春风</span><span begin="1:19.158" end="1:20.158">吹)</span></span></p><p begin="1:19.341" end="1:24.877" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.341" end="1:19.777">也</span><span begin="1:19.777" end="1:21.291">难怪我</span><span begin="1:21.291" end="1:22.188">有</span><span begin="1:22.446" end="1:23.221">点</span><span begin="1:23.221" end="1:24.877">累</span></p><p begin="1:26.087" end="1:31.781" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.087" end="1:26.459">到</span><span begin="1:26.459" end="1:28.191">夏天我</span><span begin="1:28.191" end="1:29.046">变</span><span begin="1:29.308" end="1:29.812">了</span><span begin="1:29.812" end="1:31.781">谁</span></p></div><div begin="1:56.893" end="2:11.158" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:56.893" end="2:00.399" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.893" end="1:58.173">吹过玉门</span><span begin="1:58.173" end="1:58.693">关</span> <span begin="1:58.831" end="1:59.926">吹过南泥</span><span begin="1:59.926" end="2:00.399">湾</span></p><p begin="2:00.432" end="2:03.992" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.432" end="2:02.256">你在北方注定</span><span begin="2:02.256" end="2:03.289">抛弃</span><span begin="2:03.289" end="2:03.992">谁</span></p><p begin="2:04.072" end="2:07.440" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.072" end="2:05.223">吹皱了河</span><span begin="2:05.223" end="2:05.736">水</span> <span begin="2:05.810" end="2:06.965">吹散了云</span><span begin="2:06.965" end="2:07.440">堆</span></p><p begin="2:07.450" end="2:11.158" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.450" end="2:09.240">我在世界不巧</span><span begin="2:09.240" end="2:10.330">背着</span><span begin="2:10.330" end="2:11.158">谁</span></p></div><div begin="2:11.348" end="2:23.257" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:11.348" end="2:15.799" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.348" end="2:11.695">你</span><span begin="2: