tm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.285" end="2:35.585">我</span><span begin="2:35.585" end="2:36.285">上</span><span begin="2:36.285" end="2:37.405">一次流泪</span><span begin="2:37.405" end="2:38.504">又几</span><span begin="2:38.504" end="2:39.635">岁</span></p><p begin="2:39.808" end="2:43.149" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.808" end="2:40.508">你会</span><span begin="2:40.508" end="2:41.684">退</span> <span begin="2:41.684" end="2:42.147">我想</span><span begin="2:42.147" end="2:43.149">追</span></p><p begin="2:43.159" end="2:46.443" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.159" end="2:43.761">会不</span><span begin="2:43.761" end="2:45.035">会</span> <span begin="2:45.035" end="2:45.597">对不</span><span begin="2:45.597" end="2:46.443">对</span></p><p begin="2:46.838" end="2:52.374" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.838" end="2:47.233">也</span><span begin="2:47.233" end="2:48.829">难怪我</span><span begin="2:48.829" end="2:49.753">有</span><span begin="2:49.990" end="2:50.650">点</span><span begin="2:50.650" end="2:52.374">累</span></p></div><div begin="2:53.365" end="3:13.290" itunes:songPart="Outro"><p begin="2:53.365" end="2:56.954" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.365" end="2:53.998">洞里</span><span begin="2:53.998" end="2:54.930">蛇</span> <span begin="2:55.331" end="2:55.934">冬日</span><span begin="2:55.934" end="2:56.954">睡</span></p><p begin="2:57.102" end="3:01.299" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.102" end="2:57.817">原上</span><span begin="2:57.817" end="2:58.632">草</span> <span begin="2:59.036" end="2:59.659">春风</span><span begin="2:59.659" end="3:01.299">吹</span></p><p begin="3:01.329" end="3:13.290" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.329" end="3:01.745">到</span><span begin="3:01.745" end="3:03.549">夏天我</span><span begin="3:03.549" end="3:04.420">变</span><span begin="3:05.108" end="3:06.055">了</span><span begin="3:07.113" end="3:13.290">谁</span></p></div></body></tt>